B.b0l=A.a(s(["B\u1ea5m \u22ee cu\u1ed1i m\u1ed7i d\xf2ng: Th\xf4ng tin d\xf2ng (t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7, khung, \u0103n ca, ch\u1ec9nh tay), D\xf2ng kho\xe1n, Th\xeam / Xo\xe1 d\xf2ng Ch\u01b0a ph\xe2n b\u1ed5.","\xd4 t\xean d\xf2ng n\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ecf: d\xf2ng c\xf3 l\u1ed7i, b\u1ea3n ch\u01b0a t\xednh \u0111\xfang, ph\u1ea3i s\u1eeda tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi tr\xecnh duy\u1ec7t. N\u1ec1n v\xe0ng: d\xf2ng c\xf3 c\u1ea3nh b\xe1o (v\xed d\u1ee5 ngo\xe0i khung t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7), v\u1eabn l\u01b0u v\xe0 tr\xecnh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c. Xem n\u1ed9i dung v\xe0 c\xe1ch x\u1eed l\xfd \u1edf n\xfat Th\xf4ng b\xe1o tr\xean header.","S\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n d\xf9ng v\xe0 L\xfd do \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh ch\u1eef cam: d\xf2ng ch\u1ec9nh tay, gi\u1eef nguy\xean s\u1ed1 nh\u1eadp khi t\xednh l\u1ea1i.",'Ch\u1ec9 c\xe1c d\xf2ng \u0111ang m\u1edf m\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c xu\u1ea5t file: b\u1ea5m "M\u1edf h\u1ebft" tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi xu\u1ea5t n\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ee7 c\xe1c d\xf2ng.']),t.s)
